From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:42:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mix.json: the ground sound thread's land block of 20:42Z
 (pooled ground players on)

land.voices.pool true: the 3D pre-check passed the ground battle's pooled
players (land.voices._pool and _sizes updated with how); warm 256 and most
384 as before. The land block equals sound/mix/land-block.json (the ground
thread's claude/project-thread-ixbnpu at d5e65797). Nothing in the air
block changes.

