+      "_pool": "true from 22 Nov 20:45Z: the 3D pre-check passed 8a8aac63 (compile and link on 5.8's headers, the player's reuse read against the engine's spawn: a short take out of hearing gets no voice, as before). The Mac's sound-on run compares it with -TheaterLandVoicesSpawned; set false to go back.",
       "warm": 256,
       "most": 384,
-      "_sizes": "Takes sounding at once, measured by the cloud test (each take's whole length at its pitch, or its cut and fade, and 50 ms more for the game to hear its player stop): Normandy 1944 104, Prokhorovka 130, the live 1,989-man Normandy battle 294 (its mass wide). warm covers all but that battle's peak, most is 30% over it."
+      "_sizes": "Takes sounding at once, measured by the cloud test (each take's whole length at its pitch, or its cut and fade, and 50 ms more for the game to hear its player stop): Normandy 1944 106, Prokhorovka 140, the live 1,989-man Normandy battle 303 (its mass wide), Kursk seed 11 313, Normandy seed 11 281. warm covers the content battles, most is 23% over the largest peak."
     },
